14. Implementation Priorities

Implement this update in controlled phases.

Phase 1 – Core Business Logic

- Return lifecycle.
- Inventory custody states.
- Inventory movement ledger.
- Valid state transitions.
- Order and return relationships.
- Idempotency and transaction safety.

Phase 2 – Financial Accuracy

- Order financial breakdown.
- Return expenses.
- Shipping costs.
- Financial transaction ledger.
- Dashboard financial calculations.

Phase 3 – Operational Experience

- SKU-first order creation.
- Optional extra charges.
- Shipping company details.
- Order notes and activity history.
- Returns management interface.

Phase 4 – Merchant Guidance and Product Preview

- Internal rules-based recommendations.
- Dedicated Merchant Guidance page.
- Customer-style product browsing.
- Product improvement observations.

Phase 5 – Onboarding and UX

- Optional marketplace selection.
- Website name entry.
- Persistent onboarding configuration.
